<title>POLAND: Elektrim surges in heavy trade.</title>
<headline>Elektrim surges in heavy trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish industrial and trading conglomerate Elektrim SA jumped 7.1 percent in heavy trade to 30 zlotys as institutional investors extended last week's heightened buying of blue chip stocks, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;It might be some western fund...and the stock might be helped by today's newspaper report that the GSM consortium it's in has so many customers,&quot; one trader said.</p>
<p>Nowa Europa reported on Tuesday that  PTC Era GSM SA had gained more than 40,000 customers since starting up in last year's second half.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
